# Only for Dockerfile.api (Docker picks <Dockerfile>.dockerignore over .dockerignore). Everything is left out except
# what the API needs: the code, the champion in bundle/ and the scored news. Never .env, data/ or mlruns/.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!scripts/
!frontend/
!bundle/
!outputs/predictions.parquet
!outputs/prices.parquet
**/__pycache__
